# 10A-V20. HYBRID MANIM + MOTION-CANVAS + 3D PERSPECTIVE HOMOGRAPHY ENGINE
#          (100% Free MIT-Compatible, Zero Headless-Chrome Bloat, C-Accelerated OpenCV)
